        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the area, there is a legend that a girl with purple eyes will have magical powers by the age of 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of a little witch who uses her mysterious powers to control a golem and search for a “treasure” in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/f261168351899c67ab92034a3f7107e9.webp?t=1765464642\" width=230 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was Charois' 10th birthday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She found hherself in an empty, dangerous basement where traps and suspicious shadows awaited her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charois cannot remember what happened before she came here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing she remembers is that she was told that she would reach the deepest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure to find the “treasure” in the depths begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/0d4144a9474463641b2d303f4c17e093.webp?t=1765464642\" width=230 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action RPG in which Charois, a small witch, goes underground with her golem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use skills and items to get to the deepest underground safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/19f7af13245e99731f724eeb4e44d258.webp?t=1765464642\" width=230 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memory and Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous traps lurk in the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use dowsing to see through and instantly remember what is under the ground, and avoid hazards by relying on your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, traps are not the only obstacle in your search. Pay attention to the approaching shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/128dc0af0e9c1ef9e47bcfae75ae4ada.avif?t=1765464642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras_big/128dc0af0e9c1ef9e47bcfae75ae4ada.avif?t=1765464642 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill and Item</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you explore, the more mysterious powers are enhanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underground more safely by making good use of the skills and items that are released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Piece-System can boost various stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you to decide which abilities you will rely on to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/7cf322d7c2fd6e921216992656e03ed2.avif?t=1765464642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras_big/7cf322d7c2fd6e921216992656e03ed2.avif?t=1765464642 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Event Scene</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress to the lower levels of the basement, you will be able to retrieve Charois’ memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all the memories are retrieved and her reach the deepest level of the basement, what awaits her is either treasure or ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/f4b7a231371b711afbd030e4f24e56fa.avif?t=1765464642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras_big/f4b7a231371b711afbd030e4f24e56fa.avif?t=1765464642 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has multiple endings, but there are no normal, bad, or true endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I respect all players' choices.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the area, there is a legend that a girl with purple eyes will have magical powers by the age of 10.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the story of a little witch who uses her mysterious powers to control a golem and search for a “treasure” in the depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/f261168351899c67ab92034a3f7107e9.webp?t=1765464642\" width=230 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was Charois' 10th birthday.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She found hherself in an empty, dangerous basement where traps and suspicious shadows awaited her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charois cannot remember what happened before she came here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing she remembers is that she was told that she would reach the deepest level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The adventure to find the “treasure” in the depths begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/0d4144a9474463641b2d303f4c17e093.webp?t=1765464642\" width=230 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an action RPG in which Charois, a small witch, goes underground with her golem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use skills and items to get to the deepest underground safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/19f7af13245e99731f724eeb4e44d258.webp?t=1765464642\" width=230 height=40 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Memory and Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dangerous traps lurk in the ground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use dowsing to see through and instantly remember what is under the ground, and avoid hazards by relying on your memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, traps are not the only obstacle in your search. Pay attention to the approaching shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/128dc0af0e9c1ef9e47bcfae75ae4ada.avif?t=1765464642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras_big/128dc0af0e9c1ef9e47bcfae75ae4ada.avif?t=1765464642 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skill and Item</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you explore, the more mysterious powers are enhanced.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the underground more safely by making good use of the skills and items that are released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Piece-System can boost various stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is up to you to decide which abilities you will rely on to fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/7cf322d7c2fd6e921216992656e03ed2.avif?t=1765464642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras_big/7cf322d7c2fd6e921216992656e03ed2.avif?t=1765464642 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Event Scene</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress to the lower levels of the basement, you will be able to retrieve Charois’ memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When all the memories are retrieved and her reach the deepest level of the basement, what awaits her is either treasure or ......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras/f4b7a231371b711afbd030e4f24e56fa.avif?t=1765464642\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941230/extras_big/f4b7a231371b711afbd030e4f24e56fa.avif?t=1765464642 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has multiple endings, but there are no normal, bad, or true endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I respect all players' choices.</strong></p>",
